<title>USA: MCI, BT to hold New York press conference.</title>
<headline>MCI, BT to hold New York press conference.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>MCI Communications Corp on Saturday said it was to hold a news conference with British Telecommunications Plc at the Marriott Marquis Hotel in New York on Sunday at 1400 EST/1900 GMT.</p>
<p>The two companies, which said on Friday they were in discussions on a merger, are holding a news conference in London on Sunday at 1300 GMT. -- New York Newsroom 212 859 1610</p>
